id=aod_lcd_compat
name=AOD LCD Compat
version=2.0
versionCode=2
author=cLangsdorff & Claude
description=Three-component AOD patch for LCD panels: (1) setDisplayState DOZE→MODE_NORMAL so LCD stays on during active AOD; (2) dozeScreenState OFF→DOZE_SUSPEND so TSP receives single-tap activation; (3) LightsService UnsupportedOperationException catch to prevent DozeService crash.
